SUMMARY:Panigiri of Panagia Kyra (nine-day)\, Mandraki
LOCATION:Panagia Kyra monastery\, Nisyros\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The 'ninth day' of the Dormition on 22-23 August is kept at the monastery of Panagia Kyra\, in the countryside between Mandraki and Loutra: after vespers huge tables are laid in the monastery courtyard for everyone\, with music until late. Quieter than Spiliani and more of a locals' feast.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/nisyros/#panagia-kyra-monastery-panigiri-of-panagia-kyra-nine-day-man
